    {
      "id": "claim_bafbd37984ff4afe86e46a16c51f95a9",
      "statement": "During search/zero/ref/verify wizard states, the Display polls the Sensorboard every GBW_POLL_MS (2s) with cmd 'gasbee_scan_request' and cfg_only=true; the Sensorboard filters its passive GasBee scan list to entries with config_mode set and seen within SENSOR_GASBEE_CFG_MAX_AGE_S (5s), so GasBees not currently on USB never appear to the wizard.",
