    {
      "id": "claim_827245d49a2d489b89e0c3098f660c4b",
      "statement": "cmd 'gasbee_cal_start'/'gasbee_cal_end' bracket a per-slot calibration session on the Sensorboard: while active (capped at SENSOR_GASBEE_CAL_SESSION_MAX_S=900s as a safety bound), the bottle is treated as not-connected (no empty-bottle alarm) and its consumption-rate basis is reset; gasbee_cal_end clears this immediately and is sent by the Display both on success and on wizard cancel/close.",
